<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Investment, Regent sign on Russia debt fund.</title>
<headline>Korea Investment, Regent sign on Russia debt fund.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Investment Trust Co Ltd said on Tuesday it has signed an agreement with Regent Pacific Group to set up a $150 million fund for investment in Russian and east European government bonds.</p>
<p>The Regent KITC Russian Debt Fund will invest about 90 percent of the fund in Russian bonds and the remainder in bonds issued by east European countries, the statement said.</p>
<p>The fund is expected to be formally launched within this month, an official at Korea Investment said.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
